=== ana: step 40000 of 53880 (74.239% of its plan) ===
## User

Whether a natural number is even.

## Type

type
```agda
isEven : ℕ → Bool
```

## Term

```agda
isEven zero = true
isEven (suc zero) = false
isEven (suc (suc n)) = isEven n
```

## agda

```agda
isEven-even : (n : ℕ) → isEven n ≡ true → isEven (suc n) ≡ false
```

## agda

```agda
isEven-even zero p = refl
isEven-even (suc zero) p = refl
isEven-even (suc (suc n)) p = isEven-even n p
```

## agda

```agda
isEven-odd : (n : ℕ) → isEven n ≡ true → isEven (suc n) ≡ false
```

## agda

```agda
isEven-odd zero p = refl
